<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-015" chapter-id="c-nanshi-015-xuzhaopei-father" source-id="s-nanshi-015-xuzhaopei-father-ws1659582">
  <p id="c-nanshi-015-xuzhaopei-father:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">中興元年，和帝贈<persName id="c-nanshi-015-xuzhaopei-father:p001:m0008" ref="tvq_5nw_rqn">孝嗣</persName>太尉。二年，改葬宣德太后，詔增班劍四十人，加羽葆、鼓吹，諡曰文忠，改封餘幹縣公。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-015-xuzhaopei-father:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">子<persName id="c-nanshi-015-xuzhaopei-father:p002:m0001" ref="tvq_5nw_rqn_A">緄</persName>，仕梁，位侍中，太常，信武將軍，諡頃子。</p>
</text>
